---
// Highlighted line inside a document (light blue box).
---

<p class="note"><slot /></p>

<style>
  .note {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 27px 28px 24px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: var(--cobalt-50);
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 24px;
    letter-spacing: 0.9px;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .note {
      padding: 20px;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 22px;
      letter-spacing: 0.3px;
    }
  }
</style>
